== Trivia ==
* Chimera lends its name to the fact that it is a mix of three other bosses.
** It has the body of {{E|The Cage}}.
** It has the head of either {{e|Gurglings}}, {{e|Gurdy Jr.}}, or {{e|Gurdy}}.
** It has the face of {{e|Monstro}}.
** It has behavior similar to that of all bosses stated above.
* A [[Wikipedia:Chimera (mythology)|Chimera]] in Greek mythology is a monstrous creature composed of a lion, goat, and snake.
** "The term "chimera" has come to describe any mythical or fictional creature with parts taken from various animals...".
** "Chimera" is also the medical term for a human or animal that possesses more than one set of DNA.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|Chimera's head will occasionally disappear once the body is killed, rendering them unbeatable unless the player exits the game and continues the run.}}

